{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":87,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਸਿਯੋਨ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਵਿੱਚ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਕੋਰਹ ਵੰਸ਼ੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਭਜਨ। ਗੀਤ।"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਉਹ ਦੀ ਨੀਂਹ ਪਵਿੱਤਰ ਪਰਬਤ ਵਿੱਚ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਯਾਕੂਬ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਡੇਰਿਆਂ ਨਾਲੋਂ ਸੀਯੋਨ ਦੇ ਫਾਟਕਾਂ ਨਾਲ ਵਧੇਰੇ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਰੱਖਦਾ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੇ ਸ਼ਹਿਰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੇਰੇ ਲਈ ਸ਼ਾਨਦਾਰ ਬੋਲ ਬੋਲੇ ਜਾ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ! ਸਲਹ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਆਪਣੇ ਜਾਣੂਆਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਹਬ ਅਤੇ ਬਾਬਲ ਦਾ ਚਰਚਾ ਕਰਾਂਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਵੇਖੋ, ਫ਼ਲਿਸਤ ਅਤੇ ਸੂਰ ਅਤੇ ਕੂਸ਼ ਦਾ ਵੀ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਇਹ ਉੱਥੇ ਜੰਮਿਆਂ ਸੀ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸਗੋਂ ਸੀਯੋਨ ਲਈ ਆਖਿਆ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਇਹ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਤੇ ਉਹ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਉੱਥੇ ਜੰਮੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਅੱਤ ਮਹਾਨ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਕਾਇਮ ਰੱਖੇਗਾ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਉੱਮਤਾਂ ਦੀ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਿਖੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਇਹ ਵੀ ਉੱਥੇ ਜੰਮਿਆ। ਸਲਹ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਰਾਗੀ ਅਤੇ ਨਚਾਰ ਆਖਣਗੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੇਰੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਚਸ਼ਮੇ ਤੇਰੇ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਹਨ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}